From 6e26139cecf4a3ed66c048c96dd8a5c80aad83a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hansem Ro <hansemro@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Jul 2025 15:27:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add HT32F1653/4 + HT32F52342/52 MCU support

This includes:
- HT32F1653/HT32F1654 and HT32F52342/HT32F52352 MCU support via
  chibios-contrib platform
- Generic board targets for HT32F1653/4 and HT32F52342/52
- `ht32-dfu` USB ISP bootloader target
    - USB ISP flashing support via `ht32-dfu-tool`
    - support on-demand jumping to ISP
